  "vibe": "Flour cream #f8f0dc counters, tomato #cf3b2e floods, basil #3e7a44 montage grounds and semolina gold #e8b93c — a pasta school at working temperature. Lilita One is fat and rounded on titles; Urbanist keeps the body crisp. The world is the bench itself: a wooden rolling pin tracks left to right on a 90px/s loop with its interior line spinning to show it rolling, three puffs of flour rise and expand as they fade, three tall serpentine ribbons of semolina pasta sway on separate phases, and three ravioli — dashed ink crimp, translucent tomato filling dot — pop into place one after another with an overshoot. A basil leaf rocks in the corner at 1Hz. Bounce titles, hop cuts, eight pixels of horizontal drift. Mechanics: drag a chip onto the tray, tick the mise en place, a dotted-leader menu board, and a word roll for tonight's shape.",
